{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"耶利米书","commonName":"耶利米书","title":"耶利米书","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"7cfd0f7ede9e6a98b1932bc84ae1a61e5449ad0039f95ebeb439ffee3b4ebab4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷被围"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“便雅悯人啊，你们要逃离耶路撒冷！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要在提哥亚吹响号角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在伯·哈基琳发出警报，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为有大灾难从北方逼近。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毁灭美丽娇弱的少女锡安。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首领必带着军队围攻她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在她周围安营扎寨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同牧人在各自的片区放牧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们喊道，‘准备作战！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起来吧，我们中午攻城。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们后来说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘唉！日已西沉，天色渐暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"起来吧，我们要乘夜攻打她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭她的宫殿。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们要砍伐树木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"修筑高台围攻耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这城充满压迫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"该受惩罚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的邪恶如同泉水涌流不息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴力和毁灭之声充斥城中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看见的尽是疾病和伤痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，你要接受告诫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"否则我要离弃你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你荒无人烟。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["叛逆的以色列人"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“敌人要把以色列的余民掳掠一空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同人摘葡萄摘得一个不剩。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要像摘葡萄的人一样伸手再摘枝上的葡萄。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我可以警告谁呢？谁会听呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们耳朵闭塞，什么也听不见！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和华的话他们听着逆耳，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不喜欢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我充满耶和华的烈怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无法忍而不发。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“你把我的怒气发向街头的孩童和聚集成群的青年。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丈夫和妻子、老人和长者都要一同被掳。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的房屋、田地和妻子都要交给别人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要伸手攻击这地方的居民。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们无论尊卑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"个个贪图不义之财；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无论是先知还是祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都行为诡诈。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们敷衍了事地医治我子民的伤痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说，‘没事了，没事了！’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实情况很糟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们做可憎的事会羞愧吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不！他们不知廉耻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫不脸红。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，他们要与灭亡的人一同灭亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要在我惩罚之时覆灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们要站在路口观看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寻访古道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"找到正路并行在其上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便会得到心灵的安宁。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们却说：“我们不要这样行。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：“我为你们设立守望者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提醒你们要听号角声。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们却说：“我们不听。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“列国啊，你们要听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"会众啊，要知道这些百姓的遭遇！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地啊，听着！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要降灾祸给这些百姓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们是自作自受，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为他们没有听从我的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拒绝遵守我的律法。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从示巴运来乳香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从远方带来菖蒲献给我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有什么用呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不悦纳他们的燔祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不喜欢他们的祭牲。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我要把绊脚石放在他们前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使父子一同绊倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邻居和朋友一同灭亡。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“看啊，有一个民族要从北方来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有一个强国要从地极发动进攻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女锡安啊，他们残酷无情，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手持弓箭和矛枪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骑马奔来，声势如怒海狂涛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列阵攻击你。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们听到风声，四肢发软，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"痛苦不堪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如分娩的妇人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要去田野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要在路上走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为仇敌杀气腾腾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恐怖四下弥漫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，你们要身披麻布，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在灰中打滚；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要悲伤痛哭，如丧独子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为毁灭者将突然临到我们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"text":"耶和华对我说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我派你考验我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像冶炼金属一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好察验他们的行为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们顽固不化，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如铜如铁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四处毁谤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"极其败坏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"风箱猛力吹火，铅也会熔掉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们被炼了又炼，终是徒然，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为邪恶之人仍未被清除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们被称为废弃的银渣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华已丢弃他们。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JER/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":30}